  - "ch\u1EA5t l\xEAn th\xE0nh t\u1EEBng \u0111\u1ED1ng dollar \u0111\u1EA7y ph\xF2ng"
  - count em
  - "\xFA cha \xFA cha tay \u0111\xE2u m\xE0 \u0111\u1EBFm count em up"
  - alo  alo
